{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join on an action packed adventure in The Dino Game. You are the Dino who has time traveled to the past but was ambushed by the local fauna who stole his time travel machine and weapons. Get back your weapons and fight to get the parts to rebuild your time travel machine and get back home.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 For All Ages: The game is simple and fun for all. With just the direction buttons and a single action button the only required buttons it is ideal for a person not adapt to video games as well as young children</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Charming Pixel Art Graphics: The graphics are very cute and compelling. They are a call back to retro games as well as just cute and simple. Allowing the player to use their own imagination to see what they want to see.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unique Characters: A wide cast of adorably animated pixel villagers. They are cute and silly and allow for quite a few chuckles when interacting with them.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Cool Retro Soundtrack: Enjoy chiptune melodies crafted with the same restrictions as famous 8-bit consoles.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fish Bomb</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682160/extras/8e35f0740118b460c2e11f7664f0788c.poster.avif?t=1769170104\" aria-label=\"Example of Fish Bomb\" width=426 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682160/extras/8e35f0740118b460c2e11f7664f0788c.webm?t=17